{"version":1,"content":"<p>給AI數據中心供電的設備裏，居然有從退役客機上拆下來的航空發動機。<strong>經過翻新和改造，這些發動機被重新組裝成燃氣輪機發電設備，重新投入工作。它們曾經在萬米高空為飛機提供動力，如今搖身一變，成了地面數據中心的電力希望。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587090.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.875523+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:33:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"d4a66d29310d223a8e546a9f6ae58b45b37806200b005579d94acf5686ed1a77","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}